                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The Operatic productions in the Netherlands database gives an overview of over five thousand opera productions staged in the Netherlands between 1886-1995. It is a full digitization of the Annalen van de Nederlandse Opera-gezelschappen (The Annals of the Opera Companies in the Netherlands), that was published in 1996 by the Dutch Theatre Institute and Dutch National Opera.</p>"
                }
              },
